**In the dependencies of package.json:**
 ```"express": "^5.2.1",```

**On the top second line of the main file:**
```import express from 'express';```

**At the bottom of the main file:**
```// ───── EXPRESS SERVER ─────
const app = express();
const PORT = process.env.PORT || 3000;

app.get('/', (req, res) => {
  res.send('Bot is running!');
});

app.listen(PORT, () => {
  console.log(`[WEB] Express server running on port ${PORT}`);
});
// ─────────────────────────
```
